{"parse":{"title":"Delusion Ensnares Reason","pageid":409006,"revid":2053025,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Delusion Ensnares Reason</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7e/Constellation_Delusion_Ensnares_Reason.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045637\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Delusion Ensnares Reason\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7e/Constellation_Delusion_Ensnares_Reason.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045637\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7e/Constellation_Delusion_Ensnares_Reason.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045637 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7e/Constellation_Delusion_Ensnares_Reason.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022045637 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Delusion Ensnares Reason\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Delusion_Ensnares_Reason.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Delusion Ensnares Reason.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nefer\" title=\"Nefer\">Nefer</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deceit_Cloaks_the_Truth\" title=\"Deceit Cloaks the Truth\">Deceit Cloaks the Truth</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Hides_in_the_Margins\" title=\"Opportunity Hides in the Margins\">Opportunity Hides in the Margins</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When Nefer is on the field and in the <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Shadow Dance</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Shadow Dance</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After using the Elemental Skill Senet Strategy: Dance of a Thousand Nights, Nefer will enter this state.<br />While in the Shadow Dance state, if you have at least 1 Verdant Dew, Nefer's Charged Attacks will be replaced with the special Charged Attack Phantasm Performance.<br />Nefer will exit the Shadow Dance state when she unleashes 3 Phantasm Performance(s) or the state's duration ends.</span></span></span> state, you will gain Verdant Dew 25% faster.<br />Additionally, while Nefer is in the Shadow Dance state, nearby opponents will have their <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>Dendro <a href=\"/wiki/RES\" title=\"RES\">RES</a></b></span> decreased by 20%. When Nefer exits the Shadow Dance state or after she strays a certain distance away from the opponents, this effect will be removed after 4.5s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dendro_RES_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dendro RES Reduction\">Dendro RES Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Verdant_Dew\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Verdant Dew\">Verdant Dew</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Delusion Ensnares Reason</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Nefer\" title=\"Nefer\">Nefer</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_4_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 4 Constellation\">Level 4 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-edi